<article class="ltx_document" lang="en">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Don’t Ignore the Tail: Decoupling top-<math id="m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> Probabilities for Efficient Language Model Distillation</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Sayantan Dasgupta
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
